      "sourceTextSha256": "de93c0e404600bc63c8fe7e164e616f02fafc503068da1df82abd0c8c275ba4d",
      "text": "Day 6 · The day begins with a cup of Costa Rica’s famous coffee and a hearty breakfast before the river descent continues: all the class IV rapids are on this day, about 23 km and some 30 rapids, a true test of the skills learned on the previous days. At the take-out, visit the Exploration Center, then continue to La Fortuna, at the foot of Arenal Volcano, and relax in the area’s hot springs. Overnight at Arenal Paraíso Resort & Spa. (B, L)",
